---
import type {WorkflowGuide} from '../../data/workflow-topics/types';
import {topicHref,fileHref} from '../../data/workflow-en/factory';
import WorkflowPrompt from '../preview/WorkflowPrompt.astro';
import WorkflowPractice from './WorkflowPractice.astro';
import PortraitCaseEvidence from './PortraitCaseEvidence.astro';
interface Props {topic:WorkflowGuide}
const {topic}=Astro.props;
const toc=[['result','Inputs and complete outputs'],['prepare','Preparation and capabilities'],...topic.steps.map((step,i)=>[`step-${step.id}`,`${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} ${step.title}`]),['troubleshoot','Troubleshooting and acceptance'],['downloads','Download practice files'],['sources','Sources and verification scope']];
---
<div id="main" class="wf-shell">
 <nav class="wf-breadcrumb" data-pagefind-ignore aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/en/recipes/topics/">All topics</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href={topicHref(topic)}>{topic.title}</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Complete tutorial</span></nav>
 <header class="wf-guide-hero"><div class="wf-kicker">IN-DEPTH TUTORIAL / {topic.number}</div><h1>{topic.guideTitle}</h1><p class="wf-lead">{topic.guideLead}</p><div class="wf-guide-meta"><span>Prepared by shancha</span><span>{topic.steps.length} stages · Complete prompts</span><span>{topic.files.length} practice files</span></div><div class="wf-actions"><a class="wf-button" href="#result">Explore the complete example ↓</a><a class="wf-text-link" href="#downloads">Download practice files ↗</a></div></header>
 <details class="wf-mobile-toc" data-pagefind-ignore><summary>On this page</summary><ol>{toc.map(([id,title])=><li><a href={`#${id}`}>{title}</a></li>)}</ol></details>
 <div class="wf-guide-grid"><article class="wf-prose">
  <section id="result"><div class="wf-section-title"><span>THE RESULT</span><h2 id="result-heading">Check the input, then compare the complete deliverables</h2></div><p>Explore the original materials, item-by-item outcomes and full report below. Attempt the input independently before using the reference to find omissions or disagreements.</p><div class="wf-scope"><strong>Demonstration scope</strong><p>{topic.scope}</p></div><WorkflowPractice topic={topic}/>{topic.caseId==='x-personal-portrait-site'&&<PortraitCaseEvidence/>}</section>
  <section id="prepare"><div class="wf-section-title"><span>BEFORE YOU START</span><h2 id="prepare-heading">Prepare the materials and check your tools</h2></div><div class="wf-two-cards">{topic.prepare.map(group=><div><h3>{group.title}</h3><ul>{group.items.map(text=><li>{text}</li>)}</ul></div>)}</div><p>Complete one file-based exercise first. For real services, verify the actual account, available tools and operation scope, then follow the acceptance check at each stage.</p><a class="wf-text-link" href="#downloads">Download the original input and rules ↓</a></section>
  {topic.steps.map((step,i)=><section id={`step-${step.id}`} class="wf-stage"><div class="wf-section-title"><span>STEP {String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h2 id={`step-${step.id}-heading`}>{step.title}</h2></div>{step.paragraphs.map(text=><p>{text}</p>)}<WorkflowPrompt id={`${topic.id}-${step.id}`} text={step.prompt} title={`Stage ${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} · ${step.title}`}/><div class="wf-check"><b>Expected output</b><p>{step.expected}</p></div><div class="wf-note"><strong>Acceptance check</strong><p>{step.check}</p></div>{step.note&&<p>{step.note}</p>}</section>)}
  <section id="troubleshoot"><div class="wf-section-title"><span>TROUBLESHOOTING & ACCEPTANCE</span><h2 id="troubleshoot-heading">Find the evidence before choosing the next action</h2></div><div class="wf-faq">{topic.problems.map(([question,answer])=><details><summary>{question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div><h3>Check every item before finishing</h3><p class="wf-small">These page-local checkboxes reset on refresh. Checking them does not verify a real service connection.</p><div class="wf-checklist" data-wt-checklist>{topic.checks.map((text,i)=><label><input type="checkbox"/><span><b aria-hidden="true">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</b>{text}</span></label>)}</div><p class="wf-check-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-wt-check-progress>Checked 0 / {topic.checks.length} items</p></section>
  <section id="downloads"><div class="wf-section-title"><span>PRACTICE MATERIALS</span><h2 id="downloads-heading">Download the inputs separately from the reference answers</h2></div><p>Start with input and rules without showing the reference answers. After acceptance, save the report and complete prompt set.</p><div class="wf-downloads">{topic.files.map(file=><a href={fileHref(topic,file.name)} download={!file.inline?file.name:undefined} target={file.inline?'_blank':undefined} rel={file.inline?'noopener noreferrer':undefined}><span><strong>{file.title}</strong><small>{file.description}<br/><code>{file.name}</code></small></span><b aria-hidden="true">{file.inline?'↗':'↓'}</b></a>)}</div></section>
  <section id="sources"><div class="wf-section-title"><span>SOURCES & VERIFICATION</span><h2 id="sources-heading">Check documented capabilities and exercise results separately</h2></div><div class="wf-evidence"><p><strong>Checked here:</strong> the synthetic inputs, reference outcomes, downloadable files and site interactions.{topic.guideSlug==='website-daily-check'&&' The local fixture responses and anchors can also be checked on the serving machine.'}</p><p><strong>Still unverified:</strong> {topic.verificationNote||'Your account connection, real-source reads, service writes, scheduled tasks and long-term operation. Passing this exercise does not establish those results.'}</p><p>Tutorials and prompts were independently prepared by shancha. The Chinese source edition recorded its documentation review on October 17, 2026; this English edition preserves that scope. {topic.scope}</p></div><ol class="wf-sources">{topic.sources.map(source=><li><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{source.title} ↗</a><p>{source.note}</p></li>)}</ol></section>
  <div class="wf-guide-end"><div class="wf-kicker">NEXT STEP</div><h2>Try another small batch of your own material</h2><p>Retain original input and operation records. Verify that each result can be traced before adding connections or recurring runs.</p><div class="wt-next"><a class="wf-text-link" href={topicHref(topic)}>Return to {topic.title} →</a></div></div>
 </article><aside class="wf-toc" data-pagefind-ignore aria-label="On this page"><strong>On this page</strong><ol>{toc.map(([id,title])=><li><a href={`#${id}`}>{title}</a></li>)}</ol><a class="wf-toc-back" href={topicHref(topic)}>← Back to topic</a></aside></div>
</div>
<script>
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-wt-checklist]').forEach(list=>{const update=()=>{const progress=list.nextElementSibling;if(progress?.hasAttribute('data-wt-check-progress'))progress.textContent=`Checked ${list.querySelectorAll('input:checked').length} / ${list.querySelectorAll('input').length} items`;};list.addEventListener('change',update);update();});
</script>
